<title>SRI LANKA: Tea Smallholder up on growth prospects.</title>
<headline>Tea Smallholder up on growth prospects.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tea Smallholder Factories Ltd rose 2.3 percent or 50 cents to 22 rupees on early local buying of 40,000 shares on Monday, brokers said.</p>
<p>&quot;With tea prices reaching a record high this year, investors are bullish on shares directly or indirectly connected to the industry,&quot; said a broker with a foreign joint venture.</p>
<p>The company processes tea bought from small cultivators.</p>
<p>--Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
